[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0567","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0567.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0503","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 跨框架安全策略绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.01 的 WebBrowser 控件中 IFRAME 组件存在跨框架安全策略绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页触发 NavigateComplete2 事件，绕过跨框架安全策略访问其他框架的敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 5.01 版本，CVSS 评分 2.6（AV:N/AC:H/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），攻击复杂度高、需用户交互、仅影响机密性。攻击者需诱导受害者访问恶意页面触发 NavigateComplete2 事件，可读取跨域框架内容导致信息泄露。Microsoft 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议升级至 IE 5.01 SP1 或更高版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0503"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:52Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 IE 5.01 及其所有版本，建议迁移到 IE 6+ 及以上版本或现代浏览器（Chrome/Firefox/Edge），并强制执行 ActiveX 和脚本控制策略以缓解此类漏洞风险","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q2/0154.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1311","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0503.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0503","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0503.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0503.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3h8r-hv7f-jgcx/GHSA-3h8r-hv7f-jgcx.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0503.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0503.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3a0b52cf-134d-48c7-bede-e123a8ac7cdd.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0567.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0567.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0567.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0445","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0445.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0552","title":"Mirabilis ICQ 2000A 临时文件信息泄露漏洞","description":"Mirabilis ICQ 2000A 的 Webmail 客户端在用户登录过程中会创建临时文件，但未设置正确的文件权限且登录后未自动删除，导致临时文件以全局可读权限保留在系统中。本地攻击者可通过访问该临时文件获取用户的敏感信息（如邮件内容、会话凭证等），造成信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，需本地访问权限，无需用户交互即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0552"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:58Z","remediation":"立即删除 ICQmail 客户端登录后残留于系统临时目录（如 C:\\TEMP）中的临时链接文件（.lnk 格式），该文件包含明文凭据且不会自动清除。限制临时目录的访问权限，仅允许当前用户读写。由于 Mirabilis ICQ 2000.0A 已停止维护且无安全更新，建议迁移至支持加密通信的替代即时通讯软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0237.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1307","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4607","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19993","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0552.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0552","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0552.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0552.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/icq_vulns.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-55c6-r3wh-x7cj/GHSA-55c6-r3wh-x7cj.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/icq_installed.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_600_700.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0445.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0435","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0435.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0523","title":"Etype Eserv FTP服务日志堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"EServ 2.9.2 及更早版本的 FTP 服务器在日志记录功能中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当攻击者向目标服务器发送超长的 MKD（创建目录）FTP 命令时，由于日志模块未对输入长度进行有效校验，导致写入数据超出预分配缓冲区边界，覆盖相邻内存区域。经认证的远程攻击者可精心构造恶意 MKD 命令载荷，控制溢出数据覆写返回地址，从而在服务器进程上下文中执行任意系统命令，获取完全控制权。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，属于最高危害等级，影响 EServ 2.9.2 及其之前所有版本，攻击者无需特殊权限即可实现远程代码执行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0523"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:55Z","remediation":"立即将 EServ 升级至 2.9.2 之后的修复版本（如 EServ 3.x），若新版本不再可用则应彻底停用 EServ 并替换为仍在维护的代理服务器软件（如 Squid、Nginx）。升级前可先在防火墙或路由器上限制对 EServ 管理端口（默认 21/80/8080）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，以阻断远程 MKD 命令的攻击路径。同时检查服务器日志中是否存在异常超长 MKD 请求记录，若已被利用须立即排查后门和数据泄露情况。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0009.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1315","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4614","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19997","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0523.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0523","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0523.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0523.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pg42-38hv-3f6h/GHSA-pg42-38hv-3f6h.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0523.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ad8e88eb-8f78-44fd-af04-96c18c56afb8.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0435.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0430","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0430.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0516","title":"Intel Corporation Shiva Access Manager 5.0 LDAP密码明文存储漏洞","description":"Intel Shiva Access Manager 5.0 在 Solaris 平台上配置使用 LDAP 目录存储配置信息时，将根 DN（Distinguished Name）名称和密码以明文形式存储在全局可读的文件中。本地攻击者可直接读取该文件获取 LDAP 管理凭据，从而完全控制 LDAP 服务器，导致机密性、完整性和可用性全部丧失。攻击需本地访问权限，无需身份认证，利用复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.2（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0516"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:54Z","remediation":"立即修改存储 LDAP root DN 密码的配置文件权限为 600（仅 root 可读），命令：chmod 600 /etc/opt/shiva/ldap.conf。若无法修改权限，请迁移至不依赖本地明文文件存储 LDAP 凭据的认证方案（如 SASL/GSSAPI 或 LDAPS 客户端证书认证），并限制本地用户登录权限。Intel Shiva Access Manager 5.0 已停止维护，建议尽快替换为受支持的 RADIUS/AAA 解决方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0008.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1329","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4612","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20003","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/550055bfe9781275ad9633a348ccd82fcad2554b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0516.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0516.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0516","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0516.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0516.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-05xx/CVE-2000-0516.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7db0f900e976b2d58489b930c23b9f965721c4a6/2000/CVE-2000-0516.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0516.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0516.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0516.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0430.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0403","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0403.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0482","title":"Check Point Firewall-1 碎片化数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0482是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0482"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-06T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-06-06T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Check Point Firewall-1 升级至 4.1 SP2 或更高版本，该版本已包含 IP 分片漏洞修复补丁。升级前若无法立即打补丁，可在边界防火墙上配置丢弃非法分片包的规则，启用安全策略中的 IP 分片检测功能，并对 ICMP 和 UDP 分片报文进行限速，以临时缓解拒绝服务攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19994","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b07067ca91b3ffc85e0e1474c6067f8e36d784cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0482.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0482","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/74c23eb8cb898db2cae5ec3230c8e7deb48423c4/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0482.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8109cc9beabe213e111588d9156148e0cfb893b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0482.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/812e13284092701ac2e48a9865618a02a3b2d95e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r7g3-cvfv-cr4w/GHSA-r7g3-cvfv-cr4w.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0482.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/J/jolt2.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0482.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0403.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1206","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0557","title":"Cmail 2.4.7 Web界面缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cmail 2.4.7 的 Web 管理界面存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统发送超长 GET 请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意命令执行，可完全控制受影响服务器。该漏洞影响 Cmail 2.4.7 及可能更早版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。厂商已发布修复版本，建议升级至最新版。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0557"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cmail 至 2.4.7 以上已修复版本，或联系厂商 Computalynx 获取安全补丁。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 Exchange、Postfix），并在网络边界防火墙限制对 Cmail Web 管理接口（默认 80/8000 端口）的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理网段连接。同时可在反向代理或 WAF 中配置规则，拦截超长 GET 请求以作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0248.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1318","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4626","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0557.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0557","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0557.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0557.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-985h-mmq2-8vhw/GHSA-985h-mmq2-8vhw.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0557.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e5d0caf6-ddc7-4496-a2d6-354a711eb707.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0645","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0645.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0556","title":"Cmail Web接口缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cmail 2.4.7 的 Web 界面中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向运行在 8002 端口的用户对话框发送超长用户名，触发缓冲区溢出，导致目标服务崩溃并造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Cmail 2.4.7 版本，攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可利用，但无法实现代码执行或信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0556"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:59Z","remediation":"建议升级 Cmail 至 2.4.7 以上版本（如厂商已停止维护，应替换为其他受支持的邮件服务软件）；在防火墙层面限制对 TCP 8002 端口的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0248.html","http://www.computalynx.net/news/Jun2000/news0806200001.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1319","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4625","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0556.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0556","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0556.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0556.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mqgq-47w7-8ccc/GHSA-mqgq-47w7-8ccc.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0556.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0556.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c78208cf-9dd7-40da-844c-85a22cce8fba.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0645.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0626","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0626.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0544","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0/2000 DCE/RPC SMBwriteX 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 和 Windows 2000 系统的 DCE/RPC 协议在处理 SMBwriteX 请求时存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标主机的 139/TCP 或 445/TCP 端口发送特制的包含无效数据长度的 DCE/RPC SMBwriteX 数据包，触发系统内存访问异常，导致目标系统蓝屏崩溃或服务停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，但仅影响系统可用性，不影响机密性和完整性。Microsoft 已在 MS00-066 安全公告中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0544"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:57Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-066 对应的补丁（下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=E5B0235B-EDDC-4774-9B25-E489E7A2D5E4），或在防火墙层面阻止对端口 135-139 和 445 的入站访问以缓解风险。受影响的 Windows 2000 服务器重启后可恢复 RPC 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0231.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1304","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0544.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0544","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0544.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0544.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_nt_ms00-066.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0544.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0544.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1304/info.html","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0626.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0595","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0595.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0524","title":"Microsoft Outlook 和 Outlook Express 空白邮件字段拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook 及 Outlook Express 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含空白字段（如 BCC、Reply-To、Return-Path 或 From）的特制电子邮件，导致邮件客户端在处理畸形邮件时崩溃或无法响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Outlook 和 Outlook Express 多个版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0524"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:55Z","remediation":"建议升级 Microsoft Exchange Server 至 2000 SP3 或更高版本，Outlook 升级至 2000 或更高版本，Outlook Express 升级至 6.0 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在邮件服务器或客户端配置邮件内容过滤规则，拦截包含空白 BCC/Reply-To/Return-Path/From 字段的邮件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0045.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1333","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2000/CVE-2000-0524.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0524.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0524","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/xaitax/SploitScan/blob/938d5f69569a096cf728175efd0ca15f6fd92c6a/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0524.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0524.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-37qm-483g-mfv8/GHSA-37qm-483g-mfv8.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0524.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0595.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0587","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0587.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0519","title":"微软 Internet Explorer SSL 证书验证绕过漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.x 和 5.x 存在 SSL 证书验证缺陷，当用户在同一浏览器会话中与同一服务器建立新的 SSL 会话时，浏览器未能正确重新验证服务器的 SSL 证书，属于两种不同\"SSL 证书验证\"漏洞之一。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 4.x 和 5.x 版本，CVSS 评分 2.6（AV:N/AC:H/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），属于低危漏洞。攻击条件要求攻击者诱导用户在同一 IE 会话中与同一服务器建立新的 SSL 连接，利用方式为中间人攻击者可伪造证书欺骗浏览器，导致信息泄露（仅影响机密性），Microsoft 已于 2000 年 6 月发布安全公告修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0519"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:54Z","remediation":"此漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 4.x/5.x（已停止支持）。建议：1) 升级至 Microsoft Edge（内置 IE 模式）或 Chrome/Firefox 等现代浏览器；2) 若必须使用 IE，请在“Internet 选项 → 高级 → 安全”勾选“检查服务器证书吊销”并启用“检查发布者证书吊销”；3) 部署网络层 SSL 检查设备拦截异常证书；4) 禁用 SSLv2/v3 协议，强制 TLS 1.2+。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.acrossecurity.com/aspr/ASPR-1999-12-15-1-PUB.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-10.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1309","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-039","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4627"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0587.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0586","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0586.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0518","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer SSL证书验证漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Internet Explorer 4.x 和 5.x 存在 SSL 证书验证漏洞，当通过图片或框架连接服务器时，浏览器未能正确验证 SSL 证书的所有内容。攻击者可构造恶意 SSL 证书，通过嵌入恶意图片或框架的页面诱导用户访问，绕过证书验证实施中间人攻击或欺骗攻击。该漏洞影响 IE 4.x 和 5.x 版本，CVSS 评分 2.6，攻击复杂度高，仅影响机密性。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0518"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:54Z","remediation":"升级至 Internet Explorer 6.0 或更高版本（含 SP1 补丁），或安装微软发布的安全更新 MS00-039 (Q260581)。若无法升级，可在 Internet 选项→安全→自定义级别中禁用\"跨框架/图片的 SSL 证书验证\"功能，或通过组策略禁止在非信任区域加载 HTTPS 内容作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.acrossecurity.com/aspr/ASPR-1999-12-15-1-PUB.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-10.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1309","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-039","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4624","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3619c6454232bc86bc1c5ee6d49baecbff394f3b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0518.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0518","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/581b673c344d829d047fea0ed051c916f949df9f/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0518.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f8615defb985bab445eb5487b411802098cc3657/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0518.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g344-mjvh-jcp5/GHSA-g344-mjvh-jcp5.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0518.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0518.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--b45ec747-35b5-45c1-a765-45e2a900bf90.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0586.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0442","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0442.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0537","title":"BRU 备份软件 BRUEXECLOG 环境变量本地任意文件写入漏洞","description":"BRU 备份软件中存在环境变量处理不当的安全漏洞。本地攻击者可通过设置 BRUEXECLOG 环境变量指定任意配置文件路径，导致程序以提升的权限向任意文件追加数据，从而实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 BRU 15.1 及 16.0 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。Exploit-DB 上已有公开利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0537"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:57Z","remediation":"升级 BRU 备份软件至 16.0 之后的安全版本或更高版本，若使用 Caldera OpenLinux 系统则安装补丁包 CSSA-2000-018.0（可从 Caldera 官方安全公告获取）。临时缓解措施：(1) 移除 BRU 可执行文件的 SUID/SGID 权限，执行 chmod u-s /usr/bin/bru 取消特权位；(2) 设置环境变量过滤，在 /etc/environment 或 shell 配置文件中清除 BRUEXECLOG 变量；(3) 通过文件系统挂载选项对 /etc/passwd 等敏感文件设置不可变属性（chattr +i）以防止非授权追加写入。若软件已停用，建议卸载 BRU 并替换为现代备份工具（如 restic、borgbackup）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0013.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-018.0.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1321","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4644","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19999","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0537.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0537","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0537.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0537.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q4v2-vr66-2qp6/GHSA-q4v2-vr66-2qp6.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0537.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0537.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3dd04a06-2e0d-4ac3-83db-e86d1f1d1406.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--3dd04a06-2e0d-4ac3-83db-e86d1f1d1406.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0442.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0434","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0434.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0521","title":"Michael Lamont Savant WebServer 2.1 CGI源代码泄露漏洞","description":"Michael Lamont Savant WebServer 2.1 存在 CGI 源代码泄露漏洞，由于服务器未正确校验 HTTP 请求格式，远程未经认证的攻击者可发送不包含 HTTP 版本号的畸形 GET 请求，绕过正常处理逻辑直接读取 CGI 脚本源代码。该漏洞影响 Savant WebServer 2.1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），属于信息泄露类漏洞。攻击条件简单：仅需网络访问权限，无需身份验证，构造缺少 \"HTTP/1.0\" 或 \"HTTP/1.1\" 版本标识的 GET 请求即可触发，导致服务端 CGI 程序源代码、业务逻辑及潜在敏感信息（如数据库连接串、密钥等）泄露，为后续攻击提供情报支持。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0521"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:54Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Savant WebServer 3.0 或更高版本（已修复该漏洞），或迁移至 Apache/IIS 等现代 Web 服务器。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙配置规则拦截缺少 HTTP 版本号的 GET 请求，同时禁用不必要的 CGI 脚本目录执行权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0469.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1313","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4616","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19995","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0478f8f706ece507ac234ef5b637a0cc35fcf206/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0521.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0521","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a2a94202cc0c87aa4d2db0b2a56629fac2414f8b/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0521.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b84d8f1100c46eb68c361678cfb742c6a67b7f0b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0521.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/81fda6d3109989510fd9d239f617c2df01d48799/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x348-qgpx-h8qg/GHSA-x348-qgpx-h8qg.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/savant_cgi_download.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_0_100.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0521.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/web-misc.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0434.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0434.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0614","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0614.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0536","title":"xinetd 2.1.8.x 连接限制绕过漏洞","description":"xinetd 2.1.8.x 版本中存在访问控制绕过漏洞。当使用主机名进行访问控制时，如果连接发起方的主机没有反向 DNS 记录，xinetd 无法正确限制连接，导致远程攻击者可以绕过基于主机名的访问限制策略。攻击者只需控制一个没有 PTR 记录的主机即可发起连接，无需身份认证。成功利用此漏洞可导致未授权访问受保护的服务，造成信息泄露、数据篡改或服务中断等危害。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0536"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:56Z","remediation":"升级 xinetd 至 2.3.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了反向 DNS 查询失败时访问控制绕过的问题。Debian 用户应安装安全更新 DSA-200006-1（已存档）。如无法升级，可在 xinetd 配置中使用 IP 地址而非主机名进行访问控制，避免依赖反向 DNS 解析。对于现代 Linux 系统，建议迁移至 systemd socket 激活替代 xinetd。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000619","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1381","http://www.synack.net/xinetd/","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4986","h