16T21:51:51Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 PassWD 1.2 存储密码，迁移至支持强加密算法（如 bcrypt、Argon2）的密码管理工具。若无法立即更换，应将密码文件权限设置为仅限管理员可读（chmod 600），并尽快部署密码哈希迁移脚本，将现有弱加密密码重新哈希为安全算法。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0450.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1300","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19989","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0492.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0492","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0492.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0492.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-538h-25m5-6jrw/GHSA-538h-25m5-6jrw.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0492.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--62a14563-bd47-40ab-90fc-9c0c6ae451f3.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0415.toml"}]